	(text "TO COMPLETE: 24 V input chain — SMBJ33A TVS, LM74700 ideal diode, TPS16630 eFuse; TPS54360 24→5 V (3.5 A);\nTLV75533 → +3V3 (ECU) and separate TLV75533 → +3V3_SMCU (own supervisor); TPS7A4701 low-noise rail for ADC/ref;\nV24/V48 sense dividers to ADC; isolated DC-DC B0505S-1WR3 for each isolated domain (CAN x3, speed inputs, DI field side)."
